    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1802" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄζα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠελίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					1.134
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				3.324
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dryness</i>, of the skin, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χροός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					304
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph.,
				<i>unsatisfied desire</i>, Call.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGen.</u>
				97 ii 7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>dirt, mould</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σάκος πεπαλαγμένον ἄζη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					22.184
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dry sediment</i>, Sch. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.109
			</span></i>. (Cf. Lat. <i>areo.</i>)</div>
